From 0886cfb6e08ec172e842e86ea78c91eed90dd904 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stephan Raj Ignatious Durairaj <signatio@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 15:18:48 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] agent: Preserve traffic-separation network assignments across
 reboot

Traffic-separation cleanup was removing persisted network assignments during normal reset and manager destruction, causing VAP and guest VLAN bridge configuration to be lost across reboot or reload.

Separate runtime policy cleanup from explicit persistent VLAN removal. Resolve per-BSS private and guest bridges dynamically, preserve existing UCI network assignments when classification is temporarily unavailable, and persist the resolved network during Wi-Fi credential updates.

Signed-off-by: Stephan Raj Ignatious Durairaj <signatio@qti.qualcomm.com>
